    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up alone on a tropical island in the middle of the ocean. No memories. No idea who you are \u2014 or how you ended up here.<br>Surrounded by waves and sand, you begin to make your way inland, through dense forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep in the island, you come across a strange house. It appears abandoned, but inside, everything feels like someone just stepped out for a moment. At the same time, there\u2019s something oddly familiar about the place...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the house and the island, a quiet unease begins to settle in. You can\u2019t shake the feeling that you\u2019re not alone.<br>Is this some kind of experiment? A dream? Are you losing your mind?<br>Or is there something else\u2026 waiting?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up alone on a tropical island in the middle of the ocean. No memories. No idea who you are \u2014 or how you ended up here.<br>Surrounded by waves and sand, you begin to make your way inland, through dense forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep in the island, you come across a strange house. It appears abandoned, but inside, everything feels like someone just stepped out for a moment. At the same time, there\u2019s something oddly familiar about the place...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the house and the island, a quiet unease begins to settle in. You can\u2019t shake the feeling that you\u2019re not alone.<br>Is this some kind of experiment? A dream? Are you losing your mind?<br>Or is there something else\u2026 waiting?</p>",
    "short_description": "A first-person psychological horror focused on atmosphere, exploration, and a slow descent into mystery. You wake up on a remote island with no memory and no answers \u2014 who you are or how you got there. But with every answer you find, more questions begin to surface",
